    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CRM Sync from Transcripts v3\n\nReads all Google Docs in the transcripts folder, extracts CRM fields via Claude Haiku, then creates or updates records in Attio.\n\n**Google Drive folder:** 1W3wLJTBeXuFcBaWVNpCHnyenFIoc2gRY\n**Attio list:** 4bd161bd-2b58-4c11-9ee5-004257444bb2\n\n**Field slugs:** name · name_2 · destination_city · time_to_travel · budget_range · blockers_pain_point · jtbd · journey_stage · memorable_quotes",
